#: playfield.cpp:235
msgid "Restart game"
msgstr "Reiniciar a partida"

#: playfield.cpp:236
msgid "Your opponent has requested to restart the game. Do you accept?"
msgstr "O teu contrincante solicitou reiniciar a partida. Aceptas?"

#: playfield.cpp:245
msgid ""
"Your opponent is using a pre-KDE4 version of Naval Battle. Note that, "
"according to the rules enforced by old clients, ships cannot be placed "
"adjacent to one another."
msgstr ""
"O teu contrincante está a usar unha versión do KBattleship anterior á do "
"KDE4. Lembra que, de acordo coas regras vellas, os barcos non poden tocarse."

#: playfield.cpp:258
msgid "Enemy has shot. Shoot now!"
msgstr "O inimigo disparou. Dispáralle ti agora!"

#: playfield.cpp:262
msgid "Waiting for enemy to shoot..."
msgstr "Á espera do disparo inimigo..."

#: playfield.cpp:271
msgid "Ships placed. Now shoot on the enemy field!"
msgstr "Barcos dispostos. Agora dispara no campo do inimigo!"

#: playfield.cpp:274
msgid "Waiting for other player to start the game..."
msgstr "Á espera de que outro xogador inicie a partida..."

#: playfield.cpp:278
msgid "Waiting for other player to place his ships..."
msgstr "Á espera de que o outro xogador dispoña a súa flota..."

#: playfield.cpp:286
msgid "Place your ships. Use the right mouse button to rotate them."
msgstr "Coloca os teus barcos. Usa a tecla Maiúsculas para rodalos."

